\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S.9}{\ignorespaces Test of the design: rejection rates under the null ($g=0$) at the 5 percent level. CVAR test: statistic \eqref  {eq:PT} with $\bar  c=-7$ and the critical value of \citet  {ERS1996}; bootstrap: sieve bootstrap p-value with an autoregression of order $p_T=\lceil 16(T/200)^{1/3}\rceil $; robust: adaptive test of Appendix \ref {sec:supp-test}, with the critical value from the null with uncorrelated innovations of the same design, so that its size is nominal by construction when $\delta =0$; PR: ADF-GLS of \citet  {PerronRodriguez2016} with their critical values (not tabulated for six regressors); EG: Engle-Granger with the critical values of \citet  {MacKinnon2010}; Johansen: maximum eigenvalue test. $\delta $: correlation between the innovations of the cycle and those of the controls. 1000 replications, 199 bootstrap draws.}}{29}{table.caption.69}\protected@file@percent }
